"description": "Autoneum Holding AG engages in the provision of acoustic and thermal management solutions for vehicles. It develops and produces multifunctional, lightweight components for optimal protection against noise and heat. The firm operates through the following segments: Business Groups Europe, Business Groups North America, Business Groups Asia, and Business Groups SAMEA (South America, the Middle East, and Africa). Autoneum Holding was founded on December 2, 2010 and is headquartered in Winterthur, Switzerland.",
